    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "69226521_97b081b8",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
        "patchSetId": 52
      },
      "lineNbr": 187,
      "author": {
        "id": 1399364
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-29T16:16:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible to expose this via a getter that is also synchronized? You can add @VFT(otherwise \u003d NONE), which indicates that this method shall only be called from test code. Proguard should strip away such methods from production code.\n\nI think member variables of this class are protected by \u0027this\u0027 lock. So accessing this field directly in tests means the appropriate lock won\u0027t be acquired.\n\nSame may probably also apply for mVpnRunner.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 187,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 187,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "dec7a71afe933a74927c1238919400de647b57d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2f3c5525_523f51a4",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
        "patchSetId": 52
      },
      "lineNbr": 187,
      "author": {
        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-03T22:34:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. Good point. I think we may need to lock on the VPN instance during any test verification. Locking here might not work, as the verification of some of the fields in the Ikev2VpnRunner (mVpnRunner) is also guarded by the Vpn.this lock, and doing a two-stage getter introduces potential for race conditions.\n\n(On the upside, the fact that we\u0027re mocking everything out in the tests basically guarantees us that this is run single-threaded. But you\u0027re right in that we shouldn\u0027t rely on that)\n\nThoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "69226521_97b081b8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 187,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 187,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "dec7a71afe933a74927c1238919400de647b57d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
