      "writtenOn": "2020-02-07T20:34:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah things should be mocked out in tests. I find it still a bit better to expose these via test-only getters/setters. That said, see if it possible to use public APIs directly. There is nothing better than that.",
