      "writtenOn": "2020-01-29T16:16:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ideally, it would be nice if these could be outside Vpn class. I understand that that\u0027s not possible given that these access Vpn state. But even if these have to be placed within this class, I think we can do a slightly better job by creating separate classes, so that the main skeleton of IkeV2VpnRunner is a bit cleaner.\nFor instance, it is hard for me to tell where some of the method overrides (after buildChildSessionCallback) are coming from. They look similar to buildIkeSessionCallback methods). Note that my comment is more along the lines of restructuring this so that it becomes a bit cleaner.\n\nThink about it. Make changes only if it seems feasible.",
