      "message": "Done. Added here fore readability.\n\nNET_CAPABILITY_TRUSTED is already included in the default capabilities set by the builder [1], but, it\u0027s probably worth adding here for readability or in case default capbilities changes.\n\n[1] https://osscs.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/base/core/java/android/net/NetworkCapabilities.java;l\u003d353",
