    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c49580c8_ec2c8b90",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
        "patchSetId": 52
      },
      "lineNbr": 2227,
      "author": {
        "id": 1399364
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-29T16:16:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "is there a reason why you chose *request* over *register*?\n\nAlso note, when you *request* networks, you may not receive an onLost for the current network that was satisfying the network request - http://cs/aosp-master/frameworks/base/core/java/android/net/ConnectivityManager.java?l\u003d3463-3466\n\nand http://cs/aosp-master/frameworks/base/core/java/android/net/ConnectivityManager.java?l\u003d3839-3844\n\nIf you do decide to use requestNetwork, then you should basically assume the current network is lost if an onLost for it is called, or an onAvailable with another network is called.\n\nThis thread also talks about some of this - http://b/139570489#comment28",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2227,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 2227,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "dec7a71afe933a74927c1238919400de647b57d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "24b84a94_406b0941",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
        "patchSetId": 52
      },
      "lineNbr": 2227,
      "author": {
        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-03T22:34:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah. I think it was actually as a result of that bug/thread that I chose this option - I specifically want ONLY the Network that CS chooses as the (non-VPN) \"default\", since that\u0027s the one that apps would be expecting data to go over anyways (especially for metering purposes)\n\nRegarding the network loss, during both onLost and onAvailable we teardown an old connection (before starting a new one in onAvailable)\n\nAdded some documentation here.",
      "parentUuid": "c49580c8_ec2c8b90",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2227,
        "startChar": 15,
