      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-03T22:34:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack. This call will be moved to IKE within the next few weeks, and that will be doing it on a separate thread, preferably using the async DNS lookup API.\n\nI\u0027m happy to stub this out if we\u0027re concerned about performance in the meantime.",
      "parentUuid": "66198019_08397786",
