      "writtenOn": "2020-02-07T20:34:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Don\u0027t have strong opinion on this. if-else chains usually create higher cognitive load, coz as each else block gets deeper, it becomes harder to keep track of what condition is not being met.\n\nAs for forgetting to not calling return can be tackled with unit tests.",
      "parentUuid": "f1dc8fce_f959eb47",
